Dialogue: 8,0:01:58.68,0:02:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 8,0:02:00.67,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out!
Dialogue: 8,0:02:02.99,0:02:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me out...
Dialogue: 8,0:02:12.07,0:02:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 8,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 8,0:02:17.28,0:02:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This was what woke me up a while back.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It responded to the sonar pulse
Dialogue: 8,0:02:22.33,0:02:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,she sent out.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:24.65,0:02:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it works just like {\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1}'s radar,
Dialogue: 8,0:02:29.47,0:02:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can find her.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll look for her.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:35.49,0:02:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll just starve here.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:39.17,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Focus my mind...
Dialogue: 8,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There she is.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's pretty close.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 8,0:02:56.37,0:02:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the signal's weak.
Dialogue: 8,0:02:59.09,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the radar works like the one in the game,
Dialogue: 8,0:03:01.35,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she's nearby, but she isn't moving very much.
Dialogue: 8,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those bushes...
Dialogue: 8,0:03:12.03,0:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
