Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.60,0:03:24.64,blood,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.79,720)\t(-52,48,\alpha&HFF&)\fsp6\alpha&F&\c\c\alpha&96&\alpha&F&\c\c\c\c&HDDF565&\c\blur3.75\fsp15\fs135\fscy200\fscy\fsp15\t(-12,28,\fs225\fsp30\c&HEFF67F&)}\hS\hU\hR\hV\hI\hV\hA\hL
Dialogue: 8,0:03:25.17,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, m-man...
Dialogue: 8,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And I stepped in my own poop!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die like this!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:35.94,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, please!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 8,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So put your pants on.
Dialogue: 8,0:03:44.16,0:03:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 8,0:03:46.49,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just dragged out here and forced \Ninto this weird game. I'm a mess.
Dialogue: 8,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Game?
Dialogue: 8,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "game"?
Dialogue: 8,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they making us do?!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:57.42,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 8,0:03:58.46,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, so put that thing away!
Dialogue: 8,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How many people...
Dialogue: 8,0:04:10.69,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}are there out here?
Dialogue: 8,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 8,0:04:18.05,0:04:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't remember
Dialogue: 8,0:04:20.91,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened on the plane?
Dialogue: 8,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On the plane?
Dialogue: 8,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was crazy.
Dialogue: 8,0:04:26.62,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you might be better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 8,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 8,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you know!
Dialogue: 8,0:04:35.55,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These weird guys in black suits took me away
Dialogue: 8,0:04:40.41,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and next thing I knew, I was on a plane.
Dialogue: 8,0:04:49.63,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a passenger plane.
Dialogue: 8,0:04:53.07,0:04:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was more like the deck of a cargo plane.
Dialogue: 8,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There were twenty or thirty others.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:01.29,0:05:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Both men and women, of all ages.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:04.23,0:05:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There were lots of guys around us carrying weapons as well.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:12.45,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 8,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good evening!
Dialogue: 8,0:05:16.50,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're about to enjoy a thrilling game.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that asshole treat it like a joke?
Dialogue: 8,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:24.62,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He really did talk like that the whole time.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:29.29,0:05:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This cargo plane is heading for an island in the Pacific.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's an uninhabited tropical island.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:36.10,0:05:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there's no food or water,
Dialogue: 8,0:05:38.18,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so it's not exactly what you'd call paradise.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:40.77,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want to escape, you must beat the game.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck, guys!
Dialogue: 8,0:05:46.07,0:05:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please note that any complaints, returns,\Nfutile resistance, and the like will not be allowed.
Dialogue: 8,0:05:51.95,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 8,0:05:54.00,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Screw you!
Dialogue: 8,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if you insist...
Dialogue: 8,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll give you the whole rundown.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:02.76,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm only saying this once, so listen up.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have to fight with BIMs, that is, these bombs.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fight whom, you ask?
Dialogue: 8,0:06:11.99,0:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why, the people around you right now.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:15.97,0:06:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't fuck with us!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 8,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You {\i0}must{\i1} be insane!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You want us to murder people with bombs?!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just take us home already!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think you'll get away with this?!
Dialogue: 8,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When this is over, I'm gonna—
Dialogue: 8,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be quiet...
Dialogue: 8,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or I can't finish explaining, yeah?
Dialogue: 8,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're turning up the voltage.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:43.53,0:06:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't blame me if it causes permanent damage.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back to the topic at hand...
Dialogue: 8,0:06:49.68,0:06:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're all being given different sorts of BIMs.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But to start with, each of you will only get one.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll have to wait and see what you get.
Dialogue: 8,0:06:59.81,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You only get eight, and they don't come with a manual,
Dialogue: 8,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so be careful with them.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:06.13,0:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Finally, as for how you beat the game...
Dialogue: 8,0:07:09.80,0:07:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would you all take a look at your left hands?
Dialogue: 8,0:07:13.51,0:07:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure some of you have already noticed,
Dialogue: 8,0:07:16.15,0:07:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but in your hands, we've embedded a chip.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:20.23,0:07:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's basically an IC chip that'll make it easier to recognize one another!
Dialogue: 8,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can't remove it without surgery.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:27.52,0:07:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though, if your heart stops, it'll pop right out.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:32.29,0:07:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now, I'll explain the main event.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're heading to an island,
Dialogue: 8,0:07:36.94,0:07:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and if you want to escape that island...
Dialogue: 8,0:07:43.86,0:07:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you must get eight of the chips.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:47.07,0:07:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is the only way off the island.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:50.29,0:07:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, if you get seven chips \Nother than your own, you win.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:55.23,0:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just as I said before, these can't be removed while the owner is alive.
Dialogue: 8,0:07:59.41,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll drop down to the island, \Nand you'll kill each other—
Dialogue: 8,0:08:03.22,0:08:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shut up, already!
Dialogue: 8,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've finally become so deluded you can't distinguish games from reality?
Dialogue: 8,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} said that?
Dialogue: 8,0:08:13.05,0:08:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:14.69,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't remember?
Dialogue: 8,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You really stood out.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:24.22,0:08:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since everyone else was too afraid of getting shocked to speak.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:28.23,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looked like you knew the man on the monitor.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew him?
Dialogue: 8,0:08:34.25,0:08:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 8,0:08:35.69,0:08:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but the guys in the masks grabbed you.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:39.33,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And blasted you in the head \Nwith a high-voltage stun gun.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:47.77,0:08:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You okay, man?
Dialogue: 8,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:55.26,0:08:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 8,0:08:59.13,0:09:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, they forced us into parachutes.
Dialogue: 8,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if it's your first time, don't worry!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:08.38,0:09:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These parachutes open automatically.
Dialogue: 8,0:09:10.77,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jump!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's crazy!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right! You're nuts!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:14.18,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said, go!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:18.99,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, your turn!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:20.80,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Murderer!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:22.19,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd better hurry, or the plane will pass over the island!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:25.26,0:09:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go on, staff!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't push me!
Dialogue: 8,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What about this guy?
Dialogue: 8,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tie his stuff on, and toss him out.
Dialogue: 8,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck surviving,
Dialogue: 8,0:09:42.89,0:09:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ranked-in-{\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1}'s-top-ten Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:03.33,0:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I know.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:13.21,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The blood on my head,
Dialogue: 8,0:10:15.13,0:10:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my missing memories,
Dialogue: 8,0:10:16.17,0:10:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the way I woke up in the jungle...
Dialogue: 8,0:10:18.95,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That explains how I got here.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:22.13,0:10:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why?
Dialogue: 8,0:10:24.32,0:10:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why are all the rules exactly the same as in {\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1}?
Dialogue: 8,0:10:29.61,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your only weapons are bombs,
Dialogue: 8,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}your strategy involves using radar,
Dialogue: 8,0:10:32.96,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you collect eight of the enemy's\Nitems to clear the mission.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is no coincidence.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:40.86,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew one of the people behind this game.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that means...
Dialogue: 8,0:10:45.87,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the {\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1} developers,\NTyrannos Japan, are part of this.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 8,0:10:53.77,0:10:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A simple game company couldn't pull this off!
Dialogue: 8,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 8,0:10:58.65,0:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as white as a sheet!
Dialogue: 8,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:03.35,0:11:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's say the system behind this murder game was developed by Tyrannos Japan.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:09.01,0:11:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a group of the best game creators in the world.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:12.93,0:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way their system would have any irregularities or loopholes.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words...
Dialogue: 8,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if I want out of here,
Dialogue: 8,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really have to kill seven people!
Dialogue: 8,0:11:23.35,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I really do something so horrifying?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:32.08,0:11:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to relive that feeling six more times?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:40.43,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I really do something that horrifying?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:44.85,0:11:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I justify killing people as a game?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:49.60,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting kinda weird.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:53.43,0:11:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a lot to take in.
Dialogue: 8,0:11:56.20,0:12:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost your memory, so I can understand that.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:00.04,0:12:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to work with me?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:03.34,0:12:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a lot safer than being alone in \Na dangerous place like this.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:07.11,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With him?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:10.54,0:12:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Work with him?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}True, if we work together, it'll be safer.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:16.43,0:12:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it means we'd need twice as many,
Dialogue: 8,0:12:19.33,0:12:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that is, we'd have to kill fourteen!
Dialogue: 8,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about the risks
Dialogue: 8,0:12:30.31,0:12:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,of trying to win this murder game together?
Dialogue: 8,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't do it.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:37.20,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never play a game where you kill someone.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:40.61,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should look for another way off the island.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of playing this game!
Dialogue: 8,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's naive.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't understand a thing.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. I guess I'm not much different.
Dialogue: 8,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I didn't know{\i0} BTOOOM!{\i1}...
Dialogue: 8,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I hadn't already been attacked,
Dialogue: 8,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would be saying the same thing.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:02.82,0:13:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 8,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to go with me, do you?
Dialogue: 8,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:10.18,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To a kid like you, an old man like me would just be a burden.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll go my own way.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:18.01,0:13:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:21.74,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I like how you're still saying you won't play their game.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a condition.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your BIMs.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:34.46,0:13:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I know what type they are and how many you have,
Dialogue: 8,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feel safer being with you.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:52.64,0:13:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd... rather not.
Dialogue: 8,0:13:57.14,0:14:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I showed you these, I couldn't trust you
Dialogue: 8,0:14:01.50,0:14:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,until I saw what {\i1}your{\i0} two pouches hold.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:07.58,0:14:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you think that knowing would just make us more nervous?
Dialogue: 8,0:14:13.22,0:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really explain it,
Dialogue: 8,0:14:15.41,0:14:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but these are our trump cards, \Nour nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:19.13,0:14:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'll respect each other more if \Nwe don't know what the other guy has, see?
Dialogue: 8,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's smart.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He isn't just some bumbling old man,
Dialogue: 8,0:14:29.19,0:14:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he's thought about this.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:32.22,0:14:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To survive this game, you can't \Njust be good at {\i0}BTOOOM!{\i1}.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:38.15,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your ability to deal with others will also be tested.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:44.68,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He wouldn't slow me down.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:46.98,0:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's probably better than I am.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Clever old bastard.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's more dangerous to be alone.
Dialogue: 8,0:14:59.30,0:15:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know when someone playing \Nthis insane game will attack us.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:03.22,0:15:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget what I said.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:05.15,0:15:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll join you without any conditions.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:09.89,0:15:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 8,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so lonely.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:16.66,0:15:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I haven't eaten since I came to this island.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:21.62,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't introduced myself yet, have I?
Dialogue: 8,0:15:25.01,0:15:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Taira, Taira Kiyoshi.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I work in real estate, in Osaka.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:30.17,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:34.51,0:15:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How very polite all on a sudden!
Dialogue: 8,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} younger than you,
Dialogue: 8,0:15:41.93,0:15:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only right.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:43.96,0:15:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a nice young man.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:45.69,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get caught up in their net?
Dialogue: 8,0:15:48.05,0:15:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're {\i1}caught{\i0} up here,\Nhow 'bout {\i1}catching{\i0} some fish?
Dialogue: 8,0:15:50.43,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not funny.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 8,0:15:54.98,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 8,0:15:56.03,0:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it yesterday around the same time.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear it over the waterfall.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:03.38,0:16:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go take a look.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:04.37,0:16:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 8,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My jacket... my shoes...
Dialogue: 8,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:16.72,0:16:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A plane?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:18.96,0:16:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That parachute...
Dialogue: 8,0:16:21.24,0:16:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is someone else coming?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's too small for that.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:24.82,0:16:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they coming to save us?
Dialogue: 8,0:16:28.62,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Impossible.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:30.26,0:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's...
Dialogue: 8,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, it's food!
Dialogue: 8,0:16:33.56,0:16:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Without food, everyone would be looking for \Nsomething to eat instead of playing the game.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:38.15,0:16:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The people behind this want us to play.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why they're giving us food.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira{-san}, that's food.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:48.01,0:16:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Supplies!
Dialogue: 8,0:16:49.68,0:16:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 8,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fantastic...
Dialogue: 8,0:16:52.53,0:16:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,we're saved!
Dialogue: 8,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them fell pretty close by.
Dialogue: 8,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'm going on ahead.
Dialogue: 8,0:17:00.07,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 8,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,More food?
Dialogue: 8,0:17:13.02,0:17:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 8,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap, she got there first.
Dialogue: 8,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First one there wins?
Dialogue: 8,0:17:22.26,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 8,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all mine!
Dialogue: 8,0:17:30.76,0:17:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 8,0:17:33.68,0:17:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The trunk exploded?
Dialogue: 8,0:17:54.12,0:17:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hate me for this.
Dialogue: 8,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is he?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He took the trunk, her BIMs, her chip...
Dialogue: 8,0:18:05.86,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He took everything.
Dialogue: 8,0:18:08.90,0:18:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A trap?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:10.62,0:18:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That guy in shades got here first,
Dialogue: 8,0:18:12.59,0:18:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he planted a BIM?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of{\i0} course {\i1}he did.
Dialogue: 8,0:18:17.23,0:18:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If everyone can see the food falling,
Dialogue: 8,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}people will race for it.
Dialogue: 8,0:18:24.54,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It doesn't just go to whoever arrives first.
Dialogue: 8,0:18:28.64,0:18:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The people behind this planned all that?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:33.16,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'd gotten there first...
Dialogue: 8,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they?!
Dialogue: 8,0:18:39.07,0:18:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How can everyone here
Dialogue: 8,0:18:40.94,0:18:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,kill without a second thought?
Dialogue: 8,0:18:50.03,0:18:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People are killing each other down there too...
Dialogue: 8,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not just there...
Dialogue: 8,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}everywhere on this island,
Dialogue: 8,0:19:00.04,0:19:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}people are playing
Dialogue: 8,0:19:03.04,0:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} for real.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted...
Dialogue: 8,0:19:10.94,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the food?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:13.21,0:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 8,0:19:21.86,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone dead down there!
Dialogue: 8,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't...
Dialogue: 8,0:19:25.33,0:19:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone got here before me and set a trap.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:29.32,0:19:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one step more, and it'd have gotten me too.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:35.08,0:19:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddha save us!
Dialogue: 8,0:19:37.76,0:19:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira{-san}.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:40.54,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more parachute over there.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:44.17,0:19:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we go for it,
Dialogue: 8,0:19:47.03,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we could be killed.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:49.20,0:19:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just some food. It isn't worth risking our lives over.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:54.68,0:19:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give up on it.
Dialogue: 8,0:19:58.34,0:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be 'just some food', but it's food.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:02.54,0:20:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the rules of city life will work out here, do you?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:08.44,0:20:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They say, "You can't fight on an empty stomach."
Dialogue: 8,0:20:10.95,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's true enough to be a widespread saying.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:16.18,0:20:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think about it, this will decide our future.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't beat someone who's\Nwell fed if we're starving.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:23.49,0:20:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if we don't do our best to get food,
Dialogue: 8,0:20:27.27,0:20:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't survive, right?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, then...
Dialogue: 8,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we're gonna run!
Dialogue: 8,0:20:36.67,0:20:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} going to run?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:38.72,0:20:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a minute to waste.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:41.05,0:20:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of my looks now, I was on the school track team, you know?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:44.76,0:20:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,'Course, now I'm about twice the weight I was then.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally laughed.
Dialogue: 8,0:20:54.57,0:20:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't get it, we'll give up, okay?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:58.48,0:21:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's try just a little harder.
Dialogue: 8,0:21:01.11,0:21:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 8,0:21:02.22,0:21:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 8,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 8,0:21:05.30,0:21:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, let's go!
Dialogue: 8,0:21:07.01,0:21:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
