Dialogue: 8,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 8,0:22:52.57,0:22:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful while approaching.
Dialogue: 8,0:22:55.64,0:22:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Let m-me rest for a second.
Dialogue: 8,0:22:58.14,0:22:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 8,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,While you do, I'll search for enemies.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:11.44,0:23:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one, far away.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:14.38,0:23:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, no one's close.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:17.08,0:23:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you just do?
Dialogue: 8,0:23:19.27,0:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a radar.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:20.65,0:23:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like submarine sonar.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:22.39,0:23:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps you find your opponents.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You didn't know?
Dialogue: 8,0:23:27.70,0:23:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they mentioned it on the plane.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how to use it, right?
Dialogue: 8,0:23:35.34,0:23:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 8,0:23:36.43,0:23:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a little further.
Dialogue: 8,0:24:08.54,0:24:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 8,0:24:11.17,0:24:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, right?
Dialogue: 8,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was abused,
Dialogue: 8,0:24:14.17,0:24:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and it made me go nuts!
Dialogue: 8,0:24:15.42,0:24:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's self-defense, {\i1}and{\i0} I'm a minor!
Dialogue: 8,0:24:18.43,0:24:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Man, society is full of dumbasses.
